\pard\sa200\qc\f1\fs36\b\cf1 SeriqCare\par
\fs24 Privacy Policy\b0\cf0\par

\pard\sa80\qc\f2\fs18\cf2 Effective Date: March 13, 2026\par
Last Updated: March 13, 2026\cf0\par
\pard\sa240\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Our Commitment to Privacy\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 The term \ldblquote SeriqCare Solution\rdblquote  (\ldblquote Solution\rdblquote ) includes the SeriqCare web application, the SeriqCare mobile application for smartphones and tablets (iOS and Android), any third-party software provided with this license, any services offered, and any accompanying documentation. Subject to the terms of this Agreement, SeriqCare (\ldblquote SeriqCare,\rdblquote  \ldblquote we,\rdblquote  \ldblquote our,\rdblquote  or \ldblquote us\rdblquote ) grants to Subscriber, and Subscriber accepts, a personal, non-exclusive, and non-transferable license to use the products and services offered in accordance with the documentation.\par
SeriqCare is headquartered in Pennsylvania, United States. We are committed to protecting the privacy and security of your personal information and maintaining your trust in our platform.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 The Information We Collect\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 This Privacy Policy applies to all information collected or submitted through the SeriqCare website, web application, and mobile applications (iOS and Android). Personally identifiable information we may collect includes, but is not limited to: first name, last name, agency or company name, type of organization, email address, phone number, job title, and any custom information you voluntarily submit. We may also collect information related to the management of care services, scheduling, workforce records, and client care data entered by authorized agency staff.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 The Way We Use Information\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 We use the information you provide solely to understand your needs, configure your account, and deliver the services you have requested. We do not share this information with outside parties except to the extent necessary to set up and operate your account. We use your email address to respond to communications and to send updates about SeriqCare\rquote s products and services. We never use, share, sell, or rent personally identifiable information in ways unrelated to those described in this Privacy Policy.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Session Recording and Usage Data\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 We may use session recording tools to observe user interactions within our application in order to diagnose technical issues, improve customer support, and enhance the overall user experience. This software may capture interactions such as mouse movements, clicks, scrolling, and keystrokes. Sensitive data, including any health-related or personally identifiable information, is masked by default and stored securely in compliance with applicable privacy and security standards.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Cookies\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 Technologies such as cookies, beacons, tags, and scripts are used by SeriqCare and our marketing partners, affiliates, and analytics providers. These technologies help us analyze trends, administer the website, track user interactions, and gather aggregated demographic data about our user base. We may receive reports from these companies on both an individual and aggregated basis.\par
We use cookies to store user preferences and session activity. Users can manage cookie settings at the individual browser level. If you choose to reject cookies, you may still access our website; however, certain areas or features may not function as intended.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Background Location Tracking\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 Our mobile applications (iOS and Android) may request permission to access the device\rquote s location even when the application is running in the background. This capability allows the app to continue providing accurate, location-based functionality without requiring the app to be actively open on screen.\par
Once permission is granted, the app may periodically request location updates from the device\rquote s GPS, Wi-Fi, or cellular network, depending on what is available and most power-efficient. SeriqCare handles all user location data responsibly. This includes encrypting data during transmission, giving users clear control over location permissions, and complying with all applicable privacy regulations and platform guidelines for both iOS and Android.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Log Files\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 As is common with most web services, we and our third-party tracking providers automatically gather certain information and store it in log files. This information includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, internet service provider (ISP), referring and exit pages, operating system, date and time stamps, and clickstream data. We may associate this automatically collected data with other information we hold about you.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Local Storage Objects\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 We use local storage objects (LSOs), such as HTML5, to store content and user preferences on your device. Third parties with whom we partner may also use LSOs to collect and store information in connection with features or advertising on our platform. Most browsers provide tools for managing or removing locally stored data.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Newsletters\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 If you subscribe to our newsletter, we will use your name and email address to deliver it to you. You may unsubscribe at any time by following the opt-out instructions included in each email.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Service-Related Announcements\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 We will send service-related announcements when necessary. For example, if our platform is temporarily unavailable for maintenance, we may send you a notification. These communications are not promotional, and in most cases you may not opt out of them while your account is active.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Links to Other Sites\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 The SeriqCare platform may contain links to websites not owned or controlled by SeriqCare. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those third-party sites. We encourage you to review the privacy policy of every website that collects personally identifiable information.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Service Providers\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 We work with third-party service providers, including email delivery, cloud hosting, database services, authentication, and customer support providers. When you sign up for our services, we share your personally identifiable information only to the extent necessary for those third parties to provide the relevant service on our behalf.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Social Media Features and Widgets\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 Our website may include social media features and widgets, such as buttons or links for platforms including LinkedIn, Facebook, and others. These features may collect your IP address, record the page you are visiting on our site, and set a cookie to function properly. Such features are governed by the privacy policy of the company that provides them.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 User Privacy\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 SeriqCare is committed to responsible data practices across our web application, iOS app, and Android app. Our approach includes:\par
\pard\li360\sa80\f2\fs18\bullet\tab \b Data Collection:\b0  We collect only the information necessary for the intended functionality of the platform, including name, email address, location data, device identifiers, and other data relevant to the features you use.\par
\bullet\tab \b Data Storage:\b0  User data is securely stored using encryption and access controls to prevent unauthorized access or data breaches.\par
\bullet\tab \b User Consent:\b0  We obtain explicit consent before collecting and processing personal data. Consent is informed, freely given, and may be revoked at any time.\par
\bullet\tab \b User Rights:\b0  Users have the right to access, correct, or request deletion of their personal data. We provide controls within the platform to help you manage your privacy preferences.\par
\bullet\tab \b Security Measures:\b0  We implement secure authentication, encryption of data in transit and at rest, and regular security reviews to protect against unauthorized access.\par
\bullet\tab \b Compliance:\b0  Our platform complies with applicable privacy laws and regulations, including HIPAA, and relevant state and federal requirements.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Platform Coverage\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 This Privacy Policy applies equally to all SeriqCare platform experiences:\par
\pard\li360\sa80\f2\fs18\bullet\tab \b Web Application:\b0  Accessible via any modern browser at our website\par
\bullet\tab \b iOS App:\b0  Available on the Apple App Store for iPhone and iPad\par
\bullet\tab \b Android App:\b0  Available on the Google Play Store for Android smartphones and tablets\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 All three platforms are subject to the same data collection, usage, and security standards described in this Policy.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Legal Disclosure\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 We reserve the right to disclose your personally identifiable information as required by law, such as in response to a subpoena or similar legal process, and when we believe that disclosure is necessary to protect our rights, ensure your safety or the safety of others, investigate fraud, or respond to a government request.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Business Transitions\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 In the event SeriqCare undergoes a business transition such as a merger, acquisition, or sale of all or part of its assets, your personally identifiable information may be among the assets transferred. You will be notified via email or through a prominent notice on our website of any such change in ownership or control of your personally identifiable information, as well as any choices you may have.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Our Commitment to Data Security\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 The security of your personally identifiable information is important to us. We follow generally accepted industry standards to protect the information submitted to us, both during transmission and after we receive it. No method of transmission over the Internet, or method of electronic storage, is 100% secure. Therefore, while we strive to protect your personal information, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Our Commitment to Children\rquote s Privacy\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 Protecting the privacy of children is important to us. We do not knowingly collect or maintain personally identifiable information from users we know to be under the age of 13 for sales or marketing purposes, and no part of our platform is designed to attract individuals under 13. However, some of our clients may serve individuals who are minors, and their information is safeguarded in our encrypted, access-controlled systems in accordance with applicable law.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 Changes to This Policy\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our information practices. If we make any material changes, we will notify you by email (sent to the address on file for your account) or by displaying a prominent notice on our website prior to the change taking effect. We encourage you to review this page periodically for the latest information on our privacy practices.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 How You Can Access, Correct, Delete, and Deactivate Your Information\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 You may access, correct, or request deletion of your personally identifiable information by contacting us at support@seriqcare.com. We will retain your information for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services to you. If you wish to cancel your account or request that we stop using your information, please contact us at support@seriqcare.com. We will retain and use your information as necessary to meet our legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.\par
To protect your privacy and security, we will take reasonable steps to verify your identity before granting access or making corrections to your information.\par

\pard\sa200\par

\pard\sa60\f1\fs22\b\cf1 How to Contact Us\cf0\b0\par
\pard\sa160\f2\fs18 If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our privacy practices, please contact us at:\par
\par
\b SeriqCare\b0\par
Pennsylvania, United States\par
Email: support@seriqcare.com\par
Website: www.seriqcare.com\par

